 align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0 <italic>vs</italic> 1</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">(5) Number of lymph nodes with extranodal invasion</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">No/&#x02a7d;5 <italic>vs</italic> &#x0003e;5</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0 <italic>vs</italic> 1</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">(6) Number of mitotic figures of nodal metastatic tumours</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">N0/&#x02a7d;5 <italic>vs</italic> &#x0003e;5</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0 <italic>vs</italic> 1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Total: 0&#x02013;6</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Tumor recurrence and death rates according to the PVN scores at 5 years from the initial operation</td></tr></tbody></table><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/><col align="center"/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Classes (scores)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Cases</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>TRR (&#x00025;)</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>MR (&#x00025;)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Low (0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">31</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1 (3)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Int (1/2)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">97</td><td align="center" valign="t